WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
Good morning John,  I hope that you don't mind this video today is not for you - it is for..

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.560
the aliens. Good morning aliens. I'm sure that your alien life and all of your alien business

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.120
has you very busy, so I wanted to give
you a really quick

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.940
sort of primer on our species so that it
may be just save you some research time.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.520
While standing our height is roughly 3.77·10^10

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:23.109
times the average radius of a hydrogen atom, assuming that hydrogen atoms are the same size

00:00:23.109 --> 00:00:24.400
where you are as they are for us,

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.430
which we think they probably should be.
We move around on two lower appendages

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:32.770
called "legs". We have two upper appendages called "arms" and each of  those arms has five

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:33.579
five appendages on them,

00:00:33.579 --> 00:00:37.010
which we use to manipulate objects. A
final appendage on the top of our body

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:40.360
contains the majority of our sensing organs. We can detect chemicals in the air,

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:44.030
which we call "smell" . We can detect chemicals by
direct contact which we call "taste". We can

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:47.260
take in and perceive a certain range of
wavelengths of light and we can sense

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:49.050
vibrations carried through the air.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:52.379
"Sound", or vibrations carried through the
air is the most important way that

00:00:52.379 --> 00:00:55.440
humans communicate. We also communicate by
transferring the sounds that we make into

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:58.969
symbols which we can perceive visually
and understand. Our auditory forms of

00:00:58.969 --> 00:01:02.070
communication are called "languages".
Unfortunately, many are spoken and if

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.510
two people speak two different languages, those two people will find it very

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:07.820
difficult to communicate. We get the
energy necessary for continuing our life

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:10.869
by consuming other organisms. Some of these
organisms get their energy directly from

00:01:10.869 --> 00:01:12.240
our star - those are called "plants"

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:15.280
- while other organisms that we consume are more
like us. Production of these food

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:17.270
organisms requires a great deal

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:21.840
of the available land, area and fresh
water on our planet. While our bodies are

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:24.640
fueled by the consumption of other
organisms, our society is currently

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:28.030
fueled mostly by hydrocarbon compounds
that we find inside of our planet. These

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:31.360
compounds are burned to create the energy
necessary to heat and cool our dwellings,

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:34.829
produce light, produce goods, communicate
with each other, and move stuff, including

00:01:34.829 --> 00:01:35.340
ourselves

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:39.850
around our planet. We are mortal. All of us
die, and so we must reproduce to pass our

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:42.820
genetic information to the next
generation. Two humans are required for

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:46.700
this process - a male and a female. The male
deposit his genetic material inside of the

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.070
female, where it is mixed together

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:51.470
and becomes a new human. This is one of our very
favorite things to do - we enjoy this process

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:54.670
a great deal. Human pairs will often bond
for life, though they're not always

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:56.860
male-female couples. Many times they are

00:01:56.860 --> 00:02:00.399
female-female or male-male. Humanity also
very much likes to bond together into

00:02:00.399 --> 00:02:03.180
groups. These groups are very much like
organisms in themselves. They pass

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:06.610
different ideas and world views among
themselves and between generations. Some of

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:09.599
these groups live together in
geographically defined areas. Those areas

00:02:09.599 --> 00:02:12.950
are known as "countries". Countries contain
people who are all led by the same

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:13.420
government.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.959
Countries will also occasionally go to war together, which means that they will

00:02:15.959 --> 00:02:18.750
systematically attempt to  kill humans
inside of another country in order to

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:21.860
bring down that government. The most
common reasons for this are to spread

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:22.770
an ideology,

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:25.780
or to protect the citizens of your own
country ,or to gain control of natural

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:28.849
resources, such as the hydrocarbon
compounds that I mentioned. War on our world is

00:02:28.849 --> 00:02:32.420
almost universally recognized as a
brutality, yet we continue the practice.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:34.800
And it is worth noting that war has been
a key factor in the continuing

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.510
technological development of our
civilization.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:39.510
People also organize themselves into
groups based on what deity they believe in.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:40.739
If you don't know what a deity is,

00:02:40.739 --> 00:02:44.000
they are divine all-powerful leaders who
control everything but don't let

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.400
themselves be known, except indirectly.
Not all humans believe in deities,

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.150
but most do.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:51.050
Our society functions largely on the
trading of goods. We use something

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:54.129
called "money" to facilitate this trading.
Money is represented by pieces of paper,

00:02:54.129 --> 00:02:57.060
sometimes metal disks and more and more
commonly, money is just a series of

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:59.970
numbers that is kept track of in our
global network. Without money it's

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.870
difficult to acquire food and shelter and
other basic needs. And there are still

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:06.019
people in our world who regularly die
because of their lack of money. Most of us

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:08.900
continue to find this very troubling but our
attempts to find better solutions have

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:12.430
not been entirely successful. We're running low
on fresh water. We're also running low on

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:15.760
the hydrocarbons that power our planet.
Alternatives, such as directly converting

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:18.940
sunlight into energy and using the power
locked within atoms are either dangerous

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:22.080
or not feasible. We have some experience with the 
problems of population being solved

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:26.879
by starvation or disease or war, but humans
find this extremely distasteful.

00:03:26.879 --> 00:03:31.400
If you have any guidance for us, please
send along any ideas that you have for

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:34.540
our culture to make it through to the
next stage of development. Thank you for

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.099
listening,

00:03:35.099 --> 00:03:38.489
thank you for your time, have a nice day,
however

00:03:38.489 --> 00:03:42.519
you measure days. John, I'll see you on
Wednesday.

00:03:42.519 --> 00:03:46.359
John, nerdfighters, in comments below or
possibly in a video response I would like to

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:46.840
know

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:50.489
what you would say to the aliens if you
had a chance to talk to them, because I

00:03:50.489 --> 00:03:52.150
found that a really interesting exercise.

